        "maxTokens": 512,
        "messages": [
          {
            "content": "<workspace><tmp>/workspace</workspace>\n\n<allowed-paths><tmp>/workspace</allowed-paths>\n\n<recent-user-requests>\n<request>\nAnother request.\n</request>\n<request>\nKeep the build green.\n</request>\n<request>\nplease make model.txt\n</request>\n</recent-user-requests>\n\nShell command the agent wants to run (tool bash, working directory <tmp>/workspace). Static analysis could not decide because it sh runs arbitrary code.\n\n<action>\nsh -c \"echo quiet\"\n</action>",
            "role": "user",
